# Four clean gates on TR1, plus a deliberately bouncing one on TR2.
# TR1 must count four edges, TR2 exactly one.
ticks 120
2 trigger 1 high
12 trigger 1 low
22 trigger 1 high
32 trigger 1 low
42 trigger 1 high
52 trigger 1 low
62 trigger 1 high
72 trigger 1 low

# A noisy contact: high, low, high, low, then settled high.
80 trigger 2 high
81 trigger 2 low
82 trigger 2 high
83 trigger 2 low
84 trigger 2 high
